    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿屁：爱丁堡大学，大三交换一学期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>图图：爱丁堡大学，硕士毕业，即将升博。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>留学二三事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">1:20</a> 对于留学最直观的感受是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">2:09</a> 为什么选择留学？与国内读研的方式对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">2:47</a> 考过一次考研后像扒层皮，我！要！逃！离！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">4:40</a> 升学的道路有很多种，不一定要一棵树上吊死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">5:03</a> 关于爱丁堡大学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">8:55</a> 对少数与异类的包容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 英国的吃的···</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 关于爱丁堡的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1263">21:03</a> 读博的憧憬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 读博与读硕的差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 读博之后的出路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 关于公派出国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 公派读博的文理比例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 公派回国后的限制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2051">34:11</a> 读博的原因各不相同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">35:13</a> 能否把学术做下去的点：保持中立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2333">38:53</a> 喜欢历史与喜欢历史学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 大人文相关学科的比较</span></p><span>