  <item>
    <title>Vol.03 | 人生不能刻舟求剑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6625362cc3e09d8f378447bd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6625362cc3e09d8f378447bd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Apr 2024 15:52:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿屁：职场新人</span></p><span></span><p><span>大玉：二硕归来，重返职场</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>人生不能刻舟求剑</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> &nbsp;30-40岁之间才是人生最好的年纪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> &nbsp;20岁的我们羞于面对迷茫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="724">12:04</a> &nbsp;20岁的我们要躬身入局，勇于试错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> &nbsp;考公、考编、大厂、外企该如何选？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> &nbsp;永远在变的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> &nbsp;对选择之后得失的转念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a> &nbsp;每一段经历都有它的价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> &nbsp;20岁的试错空间更大，30岁的阻力更大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> &nbsp;选择工作算是一种选择生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> &nbsp;职场中如何找到自己的定位和价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> &nbsp;面试中的我们就是看大家的气场合不合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> &nbsp;职场中哪些是软硬性实力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a> &nbsp;Stay hungry, stay foolish 与 空杯心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a> &nbsp;职场老炮→重归校园的心态与感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2843">47:23</a> &nbsp;gap读书后回归职场和校招入职场有什么差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> &nbsp;社会时钟与找到缝隙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> &nbsp;职场中晋升需要的支撑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3234">53:54</a> &nbsp;职场能力的拆解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3479">57:59</a> &nbsp;职场老炮对于新手的嘱托~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> &nbsp;找到正反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>脚本：阿屁/大玉</span></p><span></span><p><span>录音：阿屁/大玉</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿瓜</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>百忧解-范玮琪</span></p><span></span><p><span>Peter Pan Was Right-Anson Seabra</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听与联系方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在小宇宙订阅本节目。如有反馈和需求，请发邮件至PlaCeboTreatment@163.com。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《闹球甚了》下饭群+🛰：PlaCebo_Treatment暗号：闹球甚了</span></p>]]></description>
