    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Mar 2024 10:47:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿屁：爱跳舞。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小春：欧洲史爱好者，推理文学发烧友，励志于收藏西方甲胄、中古玩具、穆夏的画。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>学历可以当饭吃吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">1:21</a> 考研计划是怎样开启的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">4:10</a> 非统招考试选择的区别。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">6:48</a> 为什么自考？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a> 选择自考后悔么？怎么调节心态?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 世界就像个水上乐园，你也许是被踢进来的...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> Title的重要性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 备考窍门。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 正向反馈，认知鸿沟。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> 不死的生命力。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 学历和能力。优绩主义真的对么？这是偏见？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 报考人数减少，招生人数上升，为什么国家线还在升？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 山河四省考生，命运在背后推波助澜。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3570">59:30</a> 留学生=野鸡大学。面对质疑，怎么调整?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a> 读书的意义，不是所有人都一定要有上进心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>脚本：阿屁/小春/阿瓜</span></p><span></span><p><span>录音：阿屁/小春</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿瓜</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>百忧解-范玮琪</span></p><span></span><p><span>Up Against It-Sea Power</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听与联系方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在小宇宙订阅本节目。如有反馈和需求，请发邮件至1249828981@qq.com。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《闹球甚了》下饭群+🛰️：13482829470 暗号：闹球甚了</span></p>]]></description>
